   • G1.1.1: Collection Phase  
  – Normal collection is performed by navigating to storage, requesting the resource, and waiting for retrieval (tasks AT1–AT3).  
  – A fallback branch (G1.1.1.2) handles the low‐battery situation by navigating to the recharging station, recharging, and reassigning the mission (tasks AT4–AT6).  
   • G1.1.2: Delivery Phase  
  – Normal delivery (tasks AT7–AT8) is the first alternative.  
