| **AT8: Deliver Resource**         | Deliver the collected resource to the destination.                                                    | AND      | Delivery Location    | [1]              | The final step in the delivery phase.                                                                                                                        |
| **AT9: Return Resource to Checkpoint**    | Return the resource to the designated checkpoint.                                                     | AND      | Checkpoint           | [1]              | Used during delivery when the battery is low to secure the resource.                                                                                         |
| **AT10: Assign Remaining Task**   | Assign the remaining delivery task to another robot for further action.                              | AND      | Checkpoint           | [1]              | Ensures that the mission continues even if the current robot cannot complete delivery due to low battery.                                                     |
| **AT11: Trigger Alert and Send Report** | Trigger an alert and send a report to the sector manager if the checkpoint return fails.               | AND      | Sector Manager Office| [1]              | Provides a safety net in case the resource cannot be secured at the checkpoint.                                                                                |

